Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 02:43:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1423/1463] HERESY 1484: a plugin step's report in the tree,
 read in the studio's dialog; its summary beside the branch
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A file of a step named .txt, .json, .md or .csv is a report: a row of its own with Read (the text in the studio's dialog) and its file, no player, and no version to compare or source to pick. A step may say one summary line (300 characters at most), shown with its branch. The hook a measuring step needs (Viktor 15.10.2026, the AI detector: «наш независимый судья»); nothing of any plugin is in the studio.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
